/Producer (PyPDF2)
/NeedAppearances true
/Title (A\040New\040Reconstruction\040Method\040for\0403D\040Buildings\040from\0402D\040Vector\040Floor\040Plan)
/Author (Junfang\040Zhu\054\040Hui\040Zhang\054\040Yamei\040Wen)
/Subject (This\040paper\040proposes\040a\040method\040to\040analyze\040the\040geometry\040and\040semantic\040information\040of\0402D\040vector\040floor\040plans\054\040and\040reconstruct\040the\040corresponding\0403D\040building\040models\040automatically\056\040First\054\040the\040Shape\055opening\040graph\040\050SOG\051\040is\040introduced\040to\040recognize\040Structural\040Components\040\050SCs\051\040and\040describe\040the\040relationships\040between\040SCs\040and\040openings\040which\040are\040architectural\040components\040separating\040spaces\056\040A\040priority\040principle\040algorithm\040is\040developed\040to\040replace\040openings\040with\040wall\040equivalent\040lines\040for\040the\040purpose\040of\040later\040loop\040searching\056\040Then\054\040we\040present\040an\040odd\055even\055based\040edge\040breaking\040algorithm\040to\040preprocess\040wall\040lines\040in\040order\040to\040search\040loops\040directly\040and\040exactly\056\040After\040that\054\040all\040the\040interior\055space\040contours\054\040which\040are\040in\040fact\040rooms\040or\040aisles\054\040and\040exterior\040boundary\040contour\040can\040be\040obtained\056\040With\040the\040hierarchical\040component\040tree\040presented\054\040the\040topological\040relations\040of\040the\040whole\040building\040can\040be\040obtained\056\040Finally\054\0403D\040models\040can\040be\040generated\040after\040extruding\040loops\040to\040the\040wall\040height\040and\040cutting\040openings\040from\040the\040walls\056\040A\040drawing\040with\040severa\056\056\056)
/Keywords (10\040Jun\0402014\054\040Computer\055aided\040Design\040and\040Applications\054\040Floor\040plan\054\040Tsinghua\040University)
>>
